     pins: 60 I BF2	LOAD RWB (FROM TB) (JAMS CLEAR,SET)
     pins: 61 I BS2	PHASE (SELECTS POLARITY OF RWB OUT, 0 -> INVERTED)
     pins: 62 I AV1	RWB IN (SHIFTED INTO RWB 3)
     pins: 63 I BE2	SHIFT RWB (SHIFTS PIN AV1 INTO RWB 3, SHIFTS RWB3 TO RWB2) (RISING CLOCK)
     pins: 64 O BV1	RWB OUT (IF PHASE=1, =RWB 2; IF PHASE=0; =RWB 2-N)
